michapringle@yahoo.com wrote:

> nice work. Do any of you regular ascendies have any tips on what
> level/hp's/ac I should have for various sections of the dungeon? For
> example, to start, I like to do a small section of the mines at level 3
> until I hit about level 5, then I usually go to Sokoban, then finish
> the mines. By that time I am usually level 11. then I head down to the
> castle level, but what should my stats be like? any help would be
> appreciated.

That looks reasonably close to what I do.  Also work on your equipment and
resistances; you want to have magic cancellation of 3 (a property of
certain cloaks), magic resistance, and reflection.  AC of maybe -10 to -15
is a bare minimum for the Castle, and perhaps you want better if you're
playing something like a Tourist.  AC of -15 for me is barely ascendable if
I have lots of HP and potions of extra or full healing; I really like to
have -20 or better even for a combat wombat.

